flowchart TD
    A[Operator triggers snapshot<br>CLI / Cron / API POST] --> B[Load linked collection entries<br>user_collection JOIN source_cards]
    B --> C{Entries found?}
    C -->|No| D[Log: no linked cards<br>exit with summary]
    C -->|Yes| E[Apply --limit if set<br>cap processing count]
    E --> F[For each entry<br>asyncio.Semaphore concurrency=3]

    F --> G{Snapshot exists<br>for today?}
    G -->|Yes| H[Skip<br>increment skipped_existing]
    G -->|No| I[Fetch product page<br>curl_cffi + Chrome TLS]

    I --> J{Fetch successful?}
    J -->|No| K[Log error<br>increment errors<br>continue to next card]
    J -->|Yes| L[Parse JSON-LD block<br>parse_jsonld_price]

    L --> M{Price > 0?}
    M -->|No| N[Skip<br>increment skipped_zero_price]
    M -->|Yes| O{Dry run?}

    O -->|Yes| P[Log price<br>increment stored counter<br>no DB write]
    O -->|No| Q[INSERT price_observation<br>source=jsonld_snapshot<br>observed_at=today]

    Q --> R[Increment stored counter]

    H --> S[Next card]
    K --> S
    N --> S
    P --> S
    R --> S

    S --> T{More cards?}
    T -->|Yes| F
    T -->|No| U[Print summary<br>total / fetched / stored /<br>skipped / errors / elapsed]

    U --> V[Cron logs result<br>to logs/cron/]

    V --> W[Dashboard shows<br>accumulating price history<br>after 7+ daily runs]

    %% Styling
    style A fill:#6c757d,stroke:#adb5bd,color:#fff
    style C fill:#e9c46a,stroke:#f4a261,color:#264653
    style D fill:#d62828,stroke:#f4a261,color:#fff
    style F fill:#264653,stroke:#2a9d8f,color:#e9c46a
    style G fill:#e9c46a,stroke:#f4a261,color:#264653
